hifiberry-squeezelite (2.0.0.1560) stable; urgency=medium

  * postinst: after registering the players.d ACR drop-in, remove any stale
    inline "lms" player from audiocontrol.json. audiocontrol >= 0.7.13 loads
    players.d entries as separate players, so a leftover inline definition
    would duplicate this one.

